<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nabisco raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nabisco raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette has raised Nabisco Holdings Corp to its recommended list from a buy rating, a market source said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock closed at 36-3/4 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
